 "text": "Hello, how's everything going? Make a grid of squares on blanket and leave nothing out. Ants love warm, moist food, even in little packets. They work if you stick one colour, and even then it' mostly for kids. For adults, a proper colouring pen gives better results. They' the most aggressive. Keep snacks in a plastic box with a lid, or in a bag in a cupboard. At night, or in cool shed. And never leave food out on a table or ground cloth. That's a great idea. A bottle with a straw is easier to clean up, and it looks more like an outing than a picnic.",
